+other:
+  - |
+    Chaining ``|`` or ``&`` between retry conditions now builds a single
+    ``retry_any`` or ``retry_all`` holding every condition in ``.retries``,
+    instead of nesting them. The behaviour of the combined condition is
+    unchanged. This applies to the async retry strategies as well.
